%N A126417 Number of base 30 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by two or less.
%C A126417 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1) for base>=2n-1; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1)-2 when base=2n-2
%H A126417 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126417 <a href="/index/Rec#order_15">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (16,-89,159,231,-952,19,1840,-407,-1568,329,589,-81,-78,3,1).
%o A126417 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>2)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>2))
%Y A126417 Cf. Base 30 differing by one or less A126384.
